Unable to complete ABN/TFN registration, or add associate details in ABR.

Error messages:

Name has been obtained for the provided ACN
The ACN is not recognised by the Australian Securities and Investments Commission.

When completing ABN/TFN registration, or adding associate details, the ABR references ASIC's data base to ensure the ACN and name match. This error occurs when an effective start date of unknown is being returned from ASIC. ABR interprets this as invalid and removes the name, leaving the Name field BLANK, stopping the record from being validated.

