We are now progressively making debts on hold that are currently not included in the account balance visible.

Debts placed on hold using the ‘Non-pursuit - uneconomical to pursue' transaction are not included in the account balance - there are 2 key dates relating to these. This is due to new measures announced in the May 2024 Budget announcement. They are:

