Why did a letter not issue when the debt on hold amount was $100 or more

If the taxpayer’s debts on hold were more than $100 and there is no ‘Review your account balance’ letter, this may be because the taxpayer was not registered for myGov or there was no reliable address available to us when we went to generate a letter.

