ECA have the authorisation to update the following taxpayer details only:

taxpayer address
taxpayer phone numbers
financial institution details
email address, and
authorised contacts.

If the update is required for details:

on the above list, go to step 2
not on the above list (including taxpayer's DOB, residency, gender, credit/debit cards details), go to step 3.

ECA have now been given authority to update FID, but do not have the ability to update credit/debit card details.




