payment method, e.g. BPAY, money order, cheque, direct debit, direct credit, credit card, or post office
the date of payment
exact amount of the payment
details of the account the payment was meant to be transferred to (IT, ICA, etc)
receipt number (if known), and payment reference number (if known)
whether the taxpayer they are speaking with are authorised to make this request.

