A medium entity has an overdue document due on 28 February 2025 and remains unlodged as at 2 April 2025 when manual FTL penalty is applied.

Based on these dates the document has been overdue for 33 days, therefore:

2 periods of 28 days or part thereof will apply

the first day of both periods of 28 days or part thereof occur after 7 November 2024 and before 1 July 2026.

As such a penalty unit of $330 will apply.

