be discussed with your support officer, and
if applicable, escalated as per the Referral instructions
Opens in a new window
each request must be considered on its own merits. All relevant factors must be taken into account and consideration must be given to

information provided by the taxpayer
other information available to the Commissioner, for example, notes, account details, and the taxpayer history
PS LA 2011/19
