Some support options have strict legislative or policy requirements and may not be available in all circumstances. Where an option is not available clearly explain the reason.

You can offer external support services where appropriate. Refer to External support services section for more details.

If no immediate support option is suitable, continue to Assessment of financial difficulties and hardship.

