Escalating to Debt hardship team

You must have considered all ATO assistance options relevant to your role and determined that none are suitable or sufficient to alleviate the hardship before escalating to Debt hardship.

Warning

Before escalating to the Debt hardship team, you must:

have gathered full or detailed capacity to pay information from the taxpayer using the Capacity to Pay Macro,
