If, after gathering capacity to pay and considering all available options within your role, you are unable to assist the taxpayer with a solution and you are not hardship trained, warm transfer the call to the Debt Hardship Team on x92176.

Also provide the taxpayer with the contact number for the hardship team 1300 788 347 (hardship).

If you cannot warm transfer the call:

offer to leave the taxpayer in the queue, or
request they contact the hardship number directly as soon as able.

This ensures they speak to a hardship officer and all necessary information can be provided at first point of contact.

