Super Lump Sum Income Tax Return reminder letter

Recently the ATO has issued an email to all CRS approved application recipients for the 2024/25 financial year. This email is to remind all recipients of their obligation to include the CRS lump sum payments in their Income tax returns (ITR).

These amounts will generally prefill, however this may not be available until 14 August, depending on their superfunds reporting processes. If these payments have not prefilled when the taxpayer is lodging their return, they will need to manually include these amounts shown on the PAYG payment summary issued by their fund.

