S-1 - Information on priority processing and the hardship criteria that must be met.

Last published 25 July 2025

Favourite Notes Collapse all 
Background

S-1

This page contains details on priority processing of unclaimed superannuation money (USM) and the hardship criteria that must be met.

Warning alert:
Establish PORO
Opens in a new window
 before proceeding.

Recent updates

25/07/2025

	

Updated Evidence of hardship section.

	

SD-95909

Self Help
ATO website
Success alert:
Help the caller go to the page while on the phone.

This is a chance to educate the caller about self-help options, which may lead to:

the taxpayer using self-service in the future, and
a better taxpayer experience.

Taxpayers can obtain more information about Early access to super
Opens in a new window
