Background

This page provides information for taxpayers with hardship queries.

Financial difficulties or Serious hardship assistance requests are appropriate where a taxpayer has legitimate reasons for an inability to pay an outstanding debt.

Depending on the circumstances, when speaking with the taxpayer, it may be appropriate to mention the assistance that can be provided by external organisations. For:

