Checks
Check transactions

As you work through this procedure, check the transactions on the account look correct. The issuing of incorrect refunds is a significant risk and has the potential to undermine the integrity of the tax system.

To report any identified incorrect credits or refunds, refer to Reporting an incorrect credit/refund.
