GST at settlement

Credits in a GST Property Credit account cannot be transferred to offset an existing debt in any other account. The credits are automatically transferred into the ICA when the relevant BAS is lodged.

For example, there is a credit in the GST Property Credit account for the 01/12/2021–31/12/2021 period. This credit will automatically transfer to the ICA when the December 2021 BAS is lodged.

If a credit has not automatically transferred, only staff trained in GST at Settlement transfers can action these requests.

Specific checks and processes must be completed before and after the transfer. If they are not taken, the integrity of the GST at Settlement measures are undermined.

