Siebel - reply via ATO online services

Replying to a secure message received via Online services for agents or Online services for business.

Last published 6 July 2026

Favourite Notes Collapse all 
Background

This is the procedure to follow when you:

need to send a secure message, and
are replying to an inbound Siebel activity with a Related Receipt ID beginning with 501.

The secure message will be sent via Siebel to a:

registered agent's practice mail in Online services for agents (OSfA), or
taxpayer's secure mail in Online services for business (OSB).
